msgid "Post types to index"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mbr-isa.php:1120
msgid "Enabled but not currently registered:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mbr-isa.php:1121
msgid "these were set previously but no post type of that name exists right now — most often because the plugin or theme that registered it is inactive. Untick to remove."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mbr-isa.php:1127
msgid "(not registered)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mbr-isa.php:1133
msgid "Which post types the assistant indexes. Only published content is indexed. Custom post types appear here automatically once registered."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mbr-isa.php:1136
msgid "Only publicly-viewable post types are listed. Results are returned through a public endpoint, so private or internal post types are deliberately not offered."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mbr-isa.php:1141
msgid "PDF files"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mbr-isa.php:1145
msgid "Index PDF files from the Media Library."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mbr-isa.php:1148
msgid "Extracts the text layer from each PDF. Scanned/image-only PDFs with no text layer are skipped automatically. Results link straight to the file."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mbr-isa.php:1153
msgid "Which PDFs"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mbr-isa.php:1158
msgid "PDFs published somewhere on the site (recommended)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mbr-isa.php:1160
msgid "Indexed when a published, unprotected page either owns the file or links to it. Covers files uploaded through the Media Library, which is most of them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mbr-isa.php:1165
msgid "Only PDFs attached to a published page or post (strict)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mbr-isa.php:1167
msgid "Uses the WordPress attachment relationship only, which is set when a file is uploaded from inside the post editor. Files added through Media &rsaquo; Add New, or brought in by an import, are excluded even if pages link to them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mbr-isa.php:1172
msgid "Every PDF in the Media Library"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mbr-isa.php:1174
msgid "Includes files nothing links to — drafts, superseded documents, anything uploaded and forgotten. Choose this only if the whole library is meant to be public."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mbr-isa.php:1179
msgid "Media Library files are reachable by URL whether or not anything links to them. This setting decides whether their text also becomes searchable through the assistant."
msgstr ""

